	(text "R10: external GPS J410 and radio J420. GH4 pins 1 supply, 2 GND, 3 board TX, 4 board RX; harness crosses TX to endpoint RX."
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 26a75c96-ffbc-5db5-aa06-c6ec09e73f5d))
	(text "GPS USART6 PC6 TX / PC7 RX AF7 (DS12110 Rev10 Table12 p91); radio UART5 PB13 TX / PB12 RX AF14 (Table11 p90)."
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 579bbb63-3f35-524b-a20a-edbe58a56b0b))
	(text "TXU0202 VCCA and VCCB = main 3V3; C440/C450 and retained C443/C453 bypass the two supplies. OE has 10k pull-down. 1k UART series resistors and ground-only ESD clamps remain."
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid b29f844e-939c-5f1e-9c83-cdba205f1cad))
	(text "Reset / boot / port off: EN=0 and OE=0. Startup: EN, stable downstream supply, UART idle-high configuration, then OE. Shutdown: OE low before EN low. Incorrect OE while port off may feed a few mA through 1k; accepted."
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid e585120a-9377-5b71-9019-6369e791c15a))
	(text "Radio USB-powered with board off: TXU partial-power-down isolation protects MCU; power-pin reverse/transient qualification remains a separate bench gate."
		(at 20.32 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid be0c0a4b-896e-5082-9364-863c245f8e08))
	(text "Radio messages may never arm/fire; no port signal reaches pyro, arming or actuator nets. LR900-F band 890-915MHz: use channels 12-25 (902-915MHz) or a maker-confirmed FHSS set."
		(at 20.32 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 8adb2d79-26cc-5a61-a047-68c1ff583350))
